MC is for Magic Cancelation. It is probably one of the least ingame  
documented feature (eg does not appear  in enlightenment, ...) and is  
different from MR. Certain armor and cloaks can give you MC 1 2 or 3, the  
higher the better, which drastically reduce the chane of special attacks  
of monster succeding. IIRC, with MC3 you have only 2% chances of being  
level drain (if a hit succeed, good AC also prevent this). Check usual  
spoiler sources for more infos.

