*don't be burdened*. Especially when fighting. Especially in open areas.  
Being burdened make you actually slower thus allowing monsters to takes  
several moves between two of yours. So *don't*. Make stashes. Take only  
what you'll need with you. You don't need zillions of zormkids and gems  
past a certain point. You don't need thousands of similar wands, 1 or 2 of  
the most useful ones is usually enough. You don't need dozens of potions  
or huge bunch of scrolls. Make regular trips to your stash. Empty your  
inventory (and BoH). Keep only what you need.

But *don't* be burdened while fighting in an open area.



